## Interface: 16001
## Title: AIExport
## Notes: Type /aixport and press Create Export to copy a text report of your character, including a Biography timeline of level-ups, deaths, zones, and quests, then paste it into an AI chat. /aixport bio opens the timeline. /aixport help shows the guide and an example AI skill.
